WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:08.217
18 tests in 6 domains: IQ, EQ, CQ, RQ, executive functions and senses.

2
00:00:08.447 --> 00:00:16.319
Each test is a short timed task with its own instructions.

3
00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:21.332
Results stay on your device; export and import them as JSON.

4
00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:27.308
An atlas of constructs, ranked by how objective each measure is.

5
00:00:27.538 --> 00:00:33.537
Honest limits: provisional norms, confidence intervals, not a diagnosis.

6
00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:42.810
Eight languages and no tracking.

7
00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:47.040
Free and open source — chiuta.ro

